// spec: 2, 3
// A repeated `at` or `size` is a parse error that drops the statement; a missing one is too.
diagram "dupes" size (300,200)
box a at (10,10) size (40,40) at (20,20)
box b size (40,40) at (60,10) size (50,50)
junction j at (10,100) at (20,100)
text "t" at (100,100) at (110,100)
box c fill=red size (40,40)
box d at (200,10) style=service
box ok at (200,100) size (60,40)
